    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921520/extras/22c3f59fccdc4c899edb03225747c402.poster.avif?t=1748738449\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921520/extras/22c3f59fccdc4c899edb03225747c402.webp?t=1748738449\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>You wake up, alone. In the land you find yourself in called 'The Delta Labs', you must attempt to find your way out seemingly endless amounts of caverns of lab equipment, top of the line technology, and killer security robots. You need to watch every step you make, assure yourself that you do not fall into pits, run into lasers, or into a bath of electrified water.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921520/extras/9d7de72b4e26a73a900162c9defb89ed.poster.avif?t=1748738449\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921520/extras/9d7de72b4e26a73a900162c9defb89ed.webp?t=1748738449\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>The entire facility is void of life, nobody is around, besides two other things. You and a mysterious Droid which you must avoid<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921520/extras/dd2bcc262be129f5c2ccb2a36c5b371c.poster.avif?t=1748738449\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921520/extras/dd2bcc262be129f5c2ccb2a36c5b371c.webp?t=1748738449\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Apparatus is currently in development and coming soon. The main campaign is expected to be above 2 hours long. Apparatus is a story based 2D Sci-Fi platformer with an additional level editor. The game is designed for those who are familiar with platformers but those who enjoy a mysterious story over platforming challenges will enjoy it as well.",
